QualityResourceAssembler ..> QualityComparisonResource : creates
QualityResourceAssembler ..> QualityDeviationResource : creates
QualityResourceAssembler ..> RecordQualityAssessmentCommand : creates
QualityResourceAssembler ..> RecordWasteCommand : creates
QualityResourceAssembler ..> IdentifyQualityDeviationCommand : creates
QualityResourceAssembler ..> YieldIndicator : uses
QualityResourceAssembler ..> QualityComparison : uses
QualityResourceAssembler ..> QualityDeviation : uses
