QualityCommandService ..> RecordQualityAssessmentCommand : handles
QualityCommandService ..> RecordWasteCommand : handles
QualityCommandService ..> IdentifyQualityDeviationCommand : handles
QualityCommandService ..> IQualityAssessmentRepository
QualityCommandService ..> IWasteRecordRepository
QualityCommandService ..> IQualityDeviationRepository
QualityCommandService ..> IDomainEventPublisher
